# Example deployer patch — copy to patches/hub-app.yaml.
#
# The filename binds to the Flux Kustomization of the same name (hub-app);
# entries are applied AFTER the distribution's own patches. Patches reach
# what Helm values cannot: data-layer CRs and plain manifests.
#
# Each list entry is either a partial resource (strategic merge — kustomize
# infers the target from apiVersion/kind/metadata.name) or an explicit
# { patch, target } pair for JSON 6902 operations, which strategic merge
# cannot express (list-item removal, appends with /-).
#
# Substitution: same ${UPPER_SNAKE} parameters as values files, applied by
# Terraform at plan time; undefined parameters fail the plan. Secrets are
# forbidden in patches.
#
# Example: strategic-merge a resource-limit bump onto one deployment.
- apiVersion: apps/v1
  kind: Deployment
  metadata:
    name: moja-centralledger-service
    namespace: mojaloop
  spec:
    template:
      spec:
        containers:
          - name: centralledger-service
            resources:
              limits:
                memory: "1Gi"
